5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm so excited for our trip! I wonder where we'll go this year? Let's figure out the best place! @Victoria, @Midori, @Toshio, @Daisuke, what do you all think we should check first?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Midori"",""Toshio"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,It is good to be thorough from the start. I think we should look into the overall costs to avoid any surprises later. What do you all think about comparing the different pricing structures?,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Victoria. It's important that everyone feels comfortable with the budget. I'm also curious about how we spent our time last year, so maybe we should look into that too?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree that budget and past experiences are important. However, I believe the logistics of the journey are equally critical to ensure we actually enjoy our time there. Let's consider the travel efficiency.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with everyone. Maybe we should also check the details of where we'll stay? Like the room arrangements or the bathrooms... just to make sure everything is okay for everyone.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"That sounds like a great plan! I want to know if we can get a big house together! I'll check ""Pricing of offshore houses let whole"" and ""All-in rates against meals bought separately""!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I will look into ""All-in rates against meals bought separately"" and ""What separately booked rooms cost last time."" I want to have a clear picture of the total expenditure before we make a final decision.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'll look into ""How last year's days ran"" and ""Time alone in the shared-house year."" I think reflecting on our previous dynamics will help us choose the best environment for everyone this time.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will look into ""Ferry sailings and train time"" and ""Getting around by train and bus."" I want to see how much time we actually spend in transit before we commit to a destination.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll... I'll look into ""Bathing hours and bathroom provision"" and ""Inn mealtimes and room arrangements."" I just want to make sure the schedule and the space work for everyone.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, I just realized! If we get a big house, will we have to cook? I'm super curious if the all-in rates are way cheaper than buying snacks and meals separately! This is going to be so much fun!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"That is a valid point, Sakura. Knowing whether a package deal is more economical than paying as we go will help us avoid any unexpected costs during the trip.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Cooking together can be a lovely way to bond, but it's also important to make sure we don't overwork anyone. I'm looking forward to seeing how our time was balanced last year.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Efficiency is key. If we spend too much time on logistics or cooking, we lose the purpose of the holiday. I'll focus on the transit data to see if we can minimize the dead time.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope the room arrangements are flexible. I just don't want anyone to feel uncomfortable or crowded. I'll let you know what I find out about the bathrooms and mealtimes.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Yay! We've all picked our things! I can't wait to see what we find out. It's like a treasure hunt for our vacation! Let's hope for something super exciting!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. Let us wait for the results of our research. Having a clear set of data will allow us to make a rational and fair decision for everyone.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'm looking forward to it too. I hope the information helps us find a place where we can all relax and enjoy each other's company perfectly. See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let's review the findings in the next round and determine which destination offers the most efficient use of our time. Until then.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll do my best to find the information. I hope we can find a place where everyone feels comfortable. See you all soon.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
