60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, ""separate accommodation"" for the city break? @Victoria, does that mean we won't have that one big bill we talked about? I really want us to have a simple way to pay!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, it seems the option is phrased as separate accommodation. If that means individual hotel rooms, we risk the price discrepancies I mentioned. I would prefer we clarify if a shared rental is possible.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Even if the accommodation is separate, the city's layout allows us to meet and part naturally. It prevents us from feeling too crowded or too isolated, which I think is the most important balance for us.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"The phrasing of the city break is less ideal than we discussed, but the transit efficiency remains the priority. Compared to the island or the inn, the city still minimizes wasted time and rigid schedules.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I still think the city is best. Even if the rooms are separate, having a door and no strict timetable is really important. I think it's the only way I'll feel truly relaxed.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"But if we have separate rooms, we'll have to do a bunch of math to figure out who pays what! That's no fun! @Victoria, can we just agree to find a big place together instead?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, I agree. To ensure the total cost is transparent and fair for everyone, we should commit to a shared rental. If we choose the city, let's make it a condition that we book a single property.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,"I think that's a fair condition. As long as we have a shared space to gather in, we can maintain our bond while still having the freedom to explore the city individually when we need a break.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"Whether the rooms are separate or shared, the city break is the only option that doesn't waste our limited time on tedious travel. I will vote for the city to ensure we maximize our actual holiday.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with Toshio. The city is the only place where I won't feel trapped by a schedule. I'll vote for the city break, as long as we can find a place that's comfortable.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm still a little worried about the ""separate"" part, but if everyone says the city is the best, I'll go with it! Let's just promise to make the paying part super easy! I vote for the City Break!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"I will also vote for the City Break. While the phrasing is concerning, the efficiency and the potential for a shared rental make it the most logical choice. Let us ensure the billing is handled simply.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,"I'll vote for the City Break as well. It offers the perfect balance of togetherness and personal space, ensuring no one feels crowded or lonely. I'm sure we can make the arrangements work for everyone!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"I vote for the City Break. It is the only option that avoids the inefficiency of long travel times and rigid schedules, allowing us to return home without needing another holiday to recover.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll vote for the City Break too. I'm really relieved we're choosing this. I think it's the best way for all of us to have a good time. I vote for the City Break.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! We all agree! It's a City Break! Now let's just make sure we find a giant, awesome place to stay so we can all be together and keep the money stuff super simple!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. Let us prioritize a single rental property to ensure the costs are transparent and divided equally. I am glad we reached a rational consensus that satisfies everyone's needs.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Midori,,I'm so glad we've all found a way to be happy with the choice. I'll help look for a place that has a cozy common area for us to gather in! It's going to be wonderful.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"The decision is final. Now that we have chosen the most efficient destination, we can focus on the details. I look forward to a trip that allows us to actually relax.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm really happy we decided this. Thank you for listening to me. I'm looking forward to the trip and spending time with all of you.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
